# Delivery leftovers. Files handed over in a session arrive with their
# destination flattened into the name (apps__foo.js) or with a browser's
# duplicate suffix ("foo (1).js"). Neither belongs in the repo once the
# real file is in place, and both have shipped to the live site before.
*__*.js
*__*.cjs
*__*.json
* (1)*
* (2)*
*.patch
*.orig
*.rej

# Deploy notes live in the Claude project, not here.
DEPLOY-NOTES*.md

# Local noise
node_modules/
.vercel/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
